      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠥᠷᠴᠢᠺᠢᠨᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
      <uighur>türčikinekü</uighur>
      <cyrillic>түрчигнэх</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TYRCIGINE-</transcript>
      <definition>Onomat. verb expressing a rattling noise; to rustle; to thunder, rumble; to crackle, clatter</definition>
      <page>854</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠥᠷᠴᠢᠺᠢᠨᠠᠨ ᠪᠣᠰᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n bosxu</transcript>
          <definition> To rise suddenly with a noise (said of many people rising at the same time)</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠠᠰᠢᠨ᠎ᠠ ᠎ᠶᠢᠨ ᠮᠣᠲᠣᠷ ᠲᠥᠷᠴᠢᠺᠢᠨᠠᠺᠥ</unicode>
          <transcript>masin-a jin motor --ky</transcript>
          <definition> The motor (of an automobile or machine) roars.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
    <entry_item>
